<title>JS Namespace</title>

The <logiccolor>JS</logiccolor> namespace is a set of functions that facilitate interactions between <link introduction_to_cspro_language.csdoc>CSPro logic</link> and <link javascript_overview.csdoc>JavaScript</link>. For detailed information about using JavaScript in CSPro, see: <topic javascript_overview.csdoc />.


